{"id":"P054-1","subject":"P","unit":"P054","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P054-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n화력발전소의 발전기와 비교할 때, 수력발전기의 특징으로\n\n옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 단락비가 1과 같거나 크다.\n\n② 전기자 반작용의 영향이 작다.\n\n③ 과부하 내량이 크다.\n\n④ 전압변동률이 크다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1431}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n양수량 30mmin, 총 양정 12m의 양수 펌프용 전동\n\n기의 소요 출력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 효율은 80이다.)\n\n\n① 73.5         ② 78\n\n③ 82.6         ④ 93","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":712}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n3상 3선식 선로에서 각 선간거리가 16m, 16m, 24m\n\n일 때, 등가선간거리는 몇 m인가?\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":506},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1123}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n전원측의 선간전압이 75kV, 수전단측의 선간전압이\n\n70kV이고 상차각이 30°, 리액턴스가 10Ω일 때,\n\n선로손실을 무시하면 송전전력은 몇 MW인가?\n\n\n① 5250         ② 2625\n\n③ 525         ④ 262.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1032}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n전압이 kV, 전력이 kW일 때, 퍼센트 임피던스Ω\n\n를 도출하는데 사용하는 수식은?\n\n(단, 임피던스Ω이다.)\n\n\n               \n①            ②     \n\n               \n③            ④      ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":710},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":850}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n100MVA의 전원측으로 합성 임피던스가 8일 때,\n필요한 차단기의 용량은 몇 MVA 인가?\n\n\n① 1000         ② 1250\n\n③ 1500         ④ 2500","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1257}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n전력계통에서 부하를 서서히 증가했을 때의 극한전력을\n\n무엇이라고 하는가?\n\n\n① 정태안정 극한전력   ② 동태안정 극한전력\n\n③ 과도안정 극한전력   ④ 전압안정 극한전력","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":625},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m07-e2.webp","width":678,"height":665}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n접속점을 기준으로 왼쪽 선로의 임피던스를 Ω,\n오른쪽 선로의 임피던스를 Ω이라고 할 경우, 1번\n\n선로에서 2번 선로의 방향으로 진행파가 입사할 때,\n\n가 의 3배라면 반사파 계수는 얼마인가?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":679},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1219}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n자속밀도가 0.4m인 자기장 내에 길이가 0.25m인\n\n도체가 있다. 자속밀도의 방향과 수직으로 10N의 힘을\n\n가하여 도체를 20ms로 이동시킬 때, 도체의 유도 기전\n\n력과 도체에 흐르는 전류는 각각 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n\n     유도 기전력V    도체에 흐르는 전류A \n\n ①          2                  100\n\n ②          1                  200\n\n ③          2                  200\n\n ④          1                  100","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":681},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1003}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n발전기의 동기화력으로 인해 진동이 발생하며, 진동주기가\n\n고유진동에 가까워지면 공진작용으로 인해 진동이 증가\n\n하게 된다. 이에 대한 대처방법으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 계자극에 제동권선 설치\n\n② 전력안정화 장치 설치\n\n③ 제동저항 설치\n\n④ 직렬로 콘덴서 설치","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":879},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m10-e2.webp","width":678,"height":857}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n1200rpm의 동기발전기를 극수가 8인 발전기로 교체할\n\n때, 기존의 발전기와의 회전속도 차이는 얼마인가?\n\n(단, 주파수는 60Hz이다.)\n\n\n① 600rpm      ② 400rpm\n\n③ 300rpm      ④ 200rpm","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":534}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n변압기의 동손과 철손을 구하기 위한 시험으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n     <동손 측정 시험>     <철손 측정 시험>\n\n ①     단락시험        무부하시험\n\n ②    무부하시험        단락시험\n\n ③  여자전류 측정시험      단락시험\n\n ④    무부하시험     여자전류 측정시험","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":494}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n변압기의 자속에 대한 관계성으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 자속은 유기기전력에 비례하며, 주파수와 권선수에\n\n  반비례 한다.\n\n② 자속은 유기기전력과 주파수에 비례하며, 권선수와\n\n  반비례한다.\n\n③ 자속은 유기기전력, 주파수, 권선수와 반비례한다.\n\n④ 자속은 유기기전력과 반비례하며, 주파수와 권선수에\n\n  비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":599}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n정격출력이 200kVA, 철손이 kW, 전부하 동손이\n4.8kW인 변압기가 최대효율이 되기위한 부하율은 몇\n\n인가?\n\n\n    \n①            ②     \n\n    \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":593},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1283}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n극수가 다른 유도전동기를 직렬종속법으로 속도제어하려\n\n한다. 다음 조건에 대한 무부하속도rpm는?\n\n    극수   A전동기  : 2극, B전동기  : 4극\n\n   주파수    60Hz\n\n\n\n① 800         ② 1200\n\n③ 1500         ④ 1800","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1350}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n3상 유도 전동기에서 1차 권선 중 L1, L2 혹은 L2, L3\n\n혹은 L3, L1 중 어느 한 권선의 방향을 바꾸었을 때\n\n역방향의 토크가 발생하는 원리를 이용해 제동하는\n\n방식은 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 발전제동       ② 회생제동\n\n③ 단상제동       ④ 역전제동","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":543},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":532},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m16-e2.webp","width":696,"height":657}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n서보기구와 다른 시스템과의 차이점은?\n\n\n① 서보기구는 온도, 압력과 같은 물리적 매개변수를 제어\n\n  한다.\n\n② 서보기구는 위치 및 속도의 매개변수를 제어한다.\n\n③ 서보기구는 정적인 시스템이므로 피드백이 필요하지\n\n  않다.\n\n④ 서보기구는 대규모 산업 프로세스를 제어한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":583},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1227}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P054-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음은 함수 의 그래프이다. 함수의 위상 이동을 고려할\n\n때, 를 구하는 식은?\n\n(단, 는 주기이며, 각 함수 cos, sin는 ≧의 범위\n\n 만을 고려한다. )\n\n\n\n\n\n①        sin ②               cos           cossin\n③        sin ④               cos           cossin","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.28 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e13-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e13-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/ques